Maria Adelaide Mansini Maia, Pedro Augusto dos Santos Pfaltzgraff, Alberto Lacerda, Marcelo Eduardo Dantas, and Raimundo Almir Costa da Conceição. Guia de procedimentos técnicos do Departamento de Gestão Territorial: volume 5, versão 4, levantamento da geodiversidade 1:100.000 a 1:50.000. Serviço Geológico do Brasil, Rio de Janeiro, 2024. [Official publication and PDF](https://rigeo.sgb.gov.br/handle/doc/24804) · [Versioned manual list](https://sgb.gov.br/gestao-territorial-manuais-tecnicos).

Read the complete guide during advanced regional mapping and interpretation, identifying its purpose, classification, scale, observations, data organization, and product requirements. Compare this geodiversity method with a geological map's distinct claims and with the actual regional product. A valid map schema does not establish interpretation quality at every scale.

Free institutional publication access is supplied; preserve actual publisher and component notices before adaptation. Metadata, authors, edition/version, scale, and PDF route checked on 29 October 2026. No guide or geospatial collection is copied into the repository.

